遠い未来へと強く願い込め撒いた
We scattered them with strong wishes toward a distant future.

147
01:03:48,731 --> 01:03:51,231
希望の風を吹かせては (泳ぐ)
Letting the winds of hope blow (swimming through),

148
01:03:51,231 --> 01:03:53,731
理想の花びら 祈る明日の空
Ideal flower petals praying to tomorrow's sky.

149
01:03:53,731 --> 01:03:57,231
何百億も光る星みたいに ずっと 終わらないから
Like hundreds of billions of shining stars, it will never end.

150
01:03:57,231 --> 01:04:02,231
この笑顔が過去を強く抱きしめて 今未来にこの手伸ばしてゆくから
This smile firmly embraces the past as I reach out to the future.

151
01:04:02,231 --> 01:04:04,731
時 転んでも (それでいい) 空を見上げよう
Even if we stumble sometimes (that's fine), let's look up.

152
01:04:04,731 --> 01:04:07,231
笑い (泣いた) 日々を (すべて) 刻んでゆく
Carving out the days we laughed and cried (all of them),

153
01:04:07,231 --> 01:04:10,231
次の夢を掴み取るって約束するから 踏み出そう ここから
Promising to seize our next dream, let's step forward.

154
01:04:10,231 --> 01:04:13,231
【we are with you we are with you】
[We are with you, we are with you]

155
01:04:13,231 --> 01:04:16,231
同じ未来を見 ていたい あの夢 手にしたい
Wanting to see the same future, wanting that dream.

156
01:04:16,231 --> 01:04:20,231
【we are with you capture the moment】 触れた奇跡の中で
[We are with you, capture the moment] Amidst the miracle,

157
01:04:20,231 --> 01:04:22,731
その先まで続く空にまぎれたら
If we get lost in the endless sky beyond,

158
01:04:22,731 --> 01:04:25,731
君の場所と今をつなぎたくて
I want to connect your place with the present.

159
01:04:25,731 --> 01:04:28,231
あの涙が今の僕らを繋いで (繋いで)
Those tears connect us right now (connect us),

160
01:04:28,231 --> 01:04:31,031
この心に君のカケラがいるから
Because a piece of you is in my heart.

161
01:04:31,031 --> 01:04:33,231
強くなくてもいい (なくてもいい)
It's okay not to be strong (it's okay),

162
01:04:33,231 --> 01:04:36,231
今の光を 僕と (君と) 集め (すべて) 空に放つ
Gathering today's light with you, releasing it to the sky,

163
01:04:36,231 --> 01:04:40,231
この奇跡を僕らでそっと 輝かせるから 咲かせよう ここから (一緒に)
We'll make this miracle shine, let's bloom from here together.

164
01:04:40,231 --> 01:04:43,231
一人じゃないから 【we are one】
Because we're not alone [We are one].

165
01:05:00,428 --> 01:05:04,378
あの涙が今の僕らを繋いで
Those tears connect us now,

166
01:05:04,478 --> 01:05:09,778
夢の色が変わっても 変わらないメロディ
Even if the color of our dreams changes, this unchanging melody

167
01:05:09,778 --> 01:05:14,778
君のために 僕らのために
Is for you, is for us—

168
01:05:15,378 --> 01:05:18,078
歌おう
Let's sing out!

169
01:05:18,378 --> 01:05:24,178
いつまでも輝き続ける僕らの奇跡は 終わらないよ
Our sparkling miracle will never end, shining on forever!

170
01:05:24,278 --> 01:05:29,178
涙さえ きっかけに変えていこう
Let's turn even our tears into a new start,

171
01:05:29,278 --> 01:05:34,078
信じてくれる仲間と 一緒に 遠くへと
Together with the friends who believe in us, far away,

172
01:05:34,278 --> 01:05:38,078
どこへだって飛び出して行こう もっと遠く
Let's leap out anywhere, even further beyond!

173
01:05:38,378 --> 01:05:41,778
空を越えて
Crossing the skies—

174
01:06:12,478 --> 01:06:16,078
未来の僕らに まだ見ぬ君に
To our future selves, to you whom we have yet to meet,

175
01:06:16,278 --> 01:06:20,478
伝えたいこと たくさん あるんだ
There are so many things we want to tell you.

176
01:06:21,278 --> 01:06:24,178
伝えたい今は 当たり前なんかじゃない
The present we want to share is nothing to take for granted—

177
01:06:24,278 --> 01:06:28,378
翼を広げた
We spread our wings,

178
01:06:28,478 --> 01:06:31,278
高鳴る鼓動
With our hearts beating fast!

179
01:06:31,778 --> 01:06:34,478
手のひら つないでいくよ
Joining our hands together,

180
01:06:34,778 --> 01:06:39,278
光の中 夢の先へ
Into the light, beyond our dreams,

181
01:06:40,278 --> 01:06:44,178
羽ばたく雪は 君の願い
The fluttering snow is your wish.

182
01:06:44,278 --> 01:06:47,278
みんなで掴んだ この奇跡が
This miracle we all grasped together

183
01:06:47,378 --> 01:06:50,778
途切れないように 歌うんだ
We'll sing so it never fades away.

184
01:06:51,278 --> 01:06:54,278
もっと高く 大きな声で
Higher and higher, with a loud voice!

185
01:06:54,378 --> 01:06:59,278
僕らの未来を届け どこまでも
Delivering our future to wherever it may reach,

186
01:07:00,278 --> 01:07:07,178
響かせていくよ ひとりじゃないメロディ
Resounding our melody, because we're not alone.

187
01:07:46,778 --> 01:07:52,778
ゆっくり走れ 走れ 道に迷った 時がチャンスだ
Run slowly, run on! When you lose your way, that's your chance.

188
01:07:53,778 --> 01:07:58,278
今日はみつけてくれてありがとう
Thank you for finding me today!

189
01:08:01,278 --> 01:08:06,278
目の前のことに がむしゃらで 間違いは数えきれなくて
So reckless with what's right in front of us, mistakes too countless to count,

190
01:08:06,778 --> 01:08:10,178
一つのことに 手いっぱいで
Putting our all into just one thing,

191
01:08:10,278 --> 01:08:15,778
ただ前しか見えてなくて まだすぐ進むの?
Only able to look straight ahead—are we moving forward already?

192
01:08:16,278 --> 01:08:20,778
キラキラした言葉をもつ 必ず行こう
Holding sparkling words, let's surely go on.

193
01:08:21,278 --> 01:08:25,278
圧力に押されそう 忘れたくないよ
Almost crushed by the pressure, but I don't want to forget.

194
01:08:25,778 --> 01:08:30,778
ただ好きの気持ち ずっとの興味ばかりを
Just holding onto that simple feeling of love and endless curiosity,

195
01:08:31,278 --> 01:08:34,278
気にするのはやめよう ゆっくり走れ 走れ
Let's stop worrying about it! Run slowly, run on,

196
01:08:34,378 --> 01:08:38,778
道に迷った 時がチャンスだ 何にもないない
When you lose your way, that's your chance—when you have nothing at all,

197
01:08:39,278 --> 01:08:44,778
新しい僕が見つかるはずさ できっこないことばかり見えて
You'll find a new self! Seeing only things that can't be done,

198
01:08:45,278 --> 01:08:49,778
クルクルいつも遠回り だけど昨日よりは
Spinning around in detours as always, but compared to yesterday,

199
01:08:50,278 --> 01:08:56,278
道が見えるんならもう大丈夫
If you can see the path ahead, then everything's alright!

200
01:09:01,278 --> 01:09:05,778
踏み出してしまった 道は なかなか戻りづらくなって
The path we stepped onto has grown hard to turn back from,

201
01:09:06,278 --> 01:09:10,278
これも一つの経験だ たった一人の人生だ
But this too is an experience, this is just one person's life.

202
01:09:11,278 --> 01:09:15,778
分からないことは 分からないと 言い出せない
We can't bring ourselves to admit when we don't understand something,

203
01:09:16,278 --> 01:09:21,278
臆病な僕の みんなは攻めなかった
In our cowardice, no one blamed us.

204
01:09:21,778 --> 01:09:26,778
忘れたくないよ この僕の気持ち
I don't want to forget this feeling of mine,

205
01:09:27,278 --> 01:09:31,778
誰かを演じてた 嘘はもうやめよう
Let's stop pretending to be someone else with lies.

206
01:09:32,278 --> 01:09:36,778
ゆっくり走れ 走れ 風が吹いたら進め 正面だ
Run slowly, run on! When the wind blows, move straight ahead,

207
01:09:37,278 --> 01:09:42,778
何にもないない それよりも先は 僕次第だから
When there's nothing at all, what lies beyond depends on me!

208
01:09:43,278 --> 01:09:49,278
できっこないことばかり見えて クルクルいつも遠回り
Seeing only things that can't be done, spinning around in detours,

209
01:09:49,778 --> 01:09:55,778
だけど昨日よりは 道が見えるんならもう大丈夫
But if you can see the path ahead better than yesterday, then it's alright!

210
01:10:01,778 --> 01:10:04,632
今年で結成の目玉一となります
This year marks our milestone anniversary!

211
01:10:05,470 --> 01:10:07,510
あの一等星のさんざめく光で
With the dazzling light of that first-magnitude star,

212
01:10:07,610 --> 01:10:09,530
あなたとダンスを踊ろうか
Shall I dance with you?

213
01:10:09,830 --> 01:10:12,170
我が太陽系の鼓動に合わせて
Matching the heartbeat of our solar system,

214
01:10:12,380 --> 01:10:14,540
絡まったステップで煌めいて、星っ！
Sparkle with entangled steps, star!

215
01:10:14,790 --> 01:10:16,920
ランバダ ルンバ ふたり 宇宙でランデブーな
Rambada, Rumba, the two of us having a rendezvous in space,

216
01:10:17,080 --> 01:10:19,480
妄、惑って 夜夜眠れない
Delirious with delusion, unable to sleep night after night.

217
01:10:19,590 --> 01:10:21,770
星座になって 混ざる どんな一等星も
Becoming a constellation and mingling—no first-magnitude star

218
01:10:22,150 --> 01:10:24,730
あなたに代わる 光度はないわ
Has a luminosity that can replace you.

219
01:10:25,120 --> 01:10:27,350
校舎の裏あの日あなた見つけた
Behind the school building, that day, I found you,

220
01:10:27,440 --> 01:10:29,720
奇跡さえ 今も はなれない
Even that miracle still hasn't left me.

221
01:10:29,890 --> 01:10:32,240
隣に 繁く 見える 冥王星も
Even Pluto, visible nearby so frequently,

222
01:10:32,440 --> 01:10:34,950
生憎、今は興味がないわ
Unfortunately, I have no interest in it right now.

223
01:10:35,090 --> 01:10:37,170
星が舞いちゃって
Stars are dancing,

224
01:10:37,740 --> 01:10:40,650
胸が鳴っちゃって
My heart is beating,

225
01:10:40,750 --> 01:10:41,680
気付けば彼方――
Before I knew it, far away—

226
01:10:41,780 --> 01:10:43,670
あの一等星のさんざめく光で
With the dazzling light of that first-magnitude star,

227
01:10:43,770 --> 01:10:45,680
あなたとダンスを踊ろうか
Shall I dance with you?

228
01:10:45,920 --> 01:10:48,180
我が太陽系の法則に誘われ
Seduced by the laws of our solar system,

229
01:10:48,350 --> 01:10:50,650
交わった感度で煌めいて、星っ！
Sparkle with intersecting sensitivity, star!

230
01:10:50,800 --> 01:10:53,590
オー・オ・オー！
Oh-oh-oh!

231
01:10:53,770 --> 01:10:56,900
星間線を繋いで
Connecting the interstellar lines,

232
01:10:57,070 --> 01:10:58,860
あなたに届け
Reaching out to you,

233
01:10:59,050 --> 01:11:01,850
宇宙の果てから
From the edge of the universe,

234
01:11:02,070 --> 01:11:05,110
あなた 侵光系！
You are a phototactic system!

235
01:11:05,357 --> 01:11:07,757
ランバダ ルンバ ふたり 宇宙でランデブーな
Rambada, Rumba, the two of us having a rendezvous in space,

236
01:11:07,857 --> 01:11:10,157
妄、惑って 夜夜眠れない
Delirious with delusion, unable to sleep night after night.

237
01:11:10,257 --> 01:11:12,457
星座になって 混ざる どんな一等星も
Becoming a constellation and mingling—no first-magnitude star

238
01:11:12,657 --> 01:11:15,207
あなたに代わる 光度はないわ
Has a luminosity that can replace you.

239
01:11:15,257 --> 01:11:18,457
ラララ...
La la la...

240
01:11:37,404 --> 01:11:41,757
女神 聖女 聡明 慈愛 博愛 デスわ！
Goddess, saint, wisdom, love, charity—that's right!

241
01:11:42,114 --> 01:11:44,384
きっとヒロインなら綺麗で
Surely if I could be the girl of your dreams,

242
01:11:44,484 --> 01:11:47,324
王子様にチヤホヤされるでしょ?
Lights on me, all shining, complete with a prince?

243
01:11:47,434 --> 01:11:50,644
芋女の私もお姫様になれたらなんてね(イェイ)
What kinda dream for a plain girl like me to be a princess—just kidding! (Yay)

244
01:11:51,064 --> 01:11:53,594
バイト探し 採用ないし
Unemployed, searching for a job with no success,

245
01:11:53,754 --> 01:11:56,104
やけになって飛び込む
Desperate, I dive into

246
01:11:56,204 --> 01:11:57,744
場違いすぎる世界
A world where I don't belong at all.

247
01:11:57,944 --> 01:12:00,594
パシリばかり 雑用係
Running errands, doing all the chores,

248
01:12:00,694 --> 01:12:03,524
最悪の奴らのマネージャー就任です
Appointed as manager to these awful guys.

249
01:12:03,624 --> 01:12:05,934
バレたら最後
If I'm found out, it's the end—

250
01:12:06,094 --> 01:12:08,284
貶められるの嫌だし 生きてるためだし
I hate being humiliated, but I'm just trying to survive.

251
01:12:08,384 --> 01:12:10,674
きっとヒロインなら綺麗で
Surely if I could be the girl of your dreams,

252
01:12:10,774 --> 01:12:13,084
王子様にチヤホヤされるでしょ?
Pampered by a prince and everything?

253
01:12:13,184 --> 01:12:15,774
芋女の私もお姫様になれたらなんてね
What a dream for a plain girl like me to become a princess.

254
01:12:15,924 --> 01:12:18,014
私をプロデュースして
Produce me,

255
01:12:18,154 --> 01:12:20,604
髪も服も全部可愛くして
Make my hair and clothes entirely cute.

256
01:12:20,704 --> 01:12:24,224
いつか出会う王子様どこで何をしているの?神様
Where and what are you doing, future prince? Oh God,

257
01:12:24,324 --> 01:12:26,624
待っていますから気長に(はぁ...)
I'll be waiting patiently! (Haa...)

258
01:12:26,834 --> 01:12:29,034
ある日出会う 運命のひと
Then one day, I meet my destined someone,

259
01:12:29,134 --> 01:12:31,804
紳士な振る舞いにドキドキしちゃったんだ
His gentlemanly demeanor made my heart race.

260
01:12:31,924 --> 01:12:34,224
名前なんて聞けるはずはない
There's no way I could ask his name,

261
01:12:34,324 --> 01:12:37,044
また会いたいなんて願っているだけでした
I could only wish to see him once more.

262
01:12:37,144 --> 01:12:39,954
時間が止まる「また会えたね」と君
Time stops as you say, "We met again."

263
01:12:40,084 --> 01:12:41,764
やっぱり恋だ
It's definitely love.

264
01:12:42,074 --> 01:12:44,374
きっと少女漫画じゃ両想い
Surely in a shoujo manga, it's mutual,

265
01:12:44,474 --> 01:12:46,824
ベタでいいじゃんむしろベタがいいじゃん
Clichés are great, actually cliches are best!

266
01:12:46,934 --> 01:12:49,464
モブ女の私もヒロインなる気ありますなんてね
Even a background girl like me wants to be the heroine—just kidding!

267
01:12:49,564 --> 01:12:51,984
すぐにくっついちゃえばいい
We should just get together right away,

268
01:12:52,084 --> 01:12:53,804
悲劇いらない いいね?シェイクスピア
No tragedies needed, okay, Shakespeare?

269
01:12:54,084 --> 01:12:56,624
やっと会えた王子様
My long-awaited prince,

270
01:12:56,724 --> 01:12:59,024
まずは名前を知ることだよね
First, I need to know his name.

271
01:12:59,204 --> 01:13:01,524
ヒロインらしく自然に
Naturally, like a true heroine,

272
01:13:01,624 --> 01:13:03,884
バレちゃった最悪の奴らに
Caught by those awful guys who said,

273
01:13:06,257 --> 01:13:07,024
「これじゃあだめ100振られる」ってどうすればいいのー!?
"'That won't do, you'll be rejected 100 times!' What should I do?!"

274
01:13:07,144 --> 01:13:09,644
気持ちなら負けないなんてみんな同じこと考えてて
Everyone thinks their feelings won't lose to anyone,

275
01:13:09,744 --> 01:13:12,204
そこからの勇気と押しが大事なんです
That's why courage and persistence are crucial!

276
01:13:12,314 --> 01:13:13,784
聞いてる!?
Are you listening?!

277
01:13:13,884 --> 01:13:16,194
きっとヒロインなら綺麗で
Surely if I could be the girl of your dreams,

278
01:13:16,294 --> 01:13:18,604
王子様にチヤホヤされるでしょ?
Pampered by a prince and everything?

279
01:13:18,704 --> 01:13:21,124
芋女の私もお姫様になれたらなんてね
What a dream for a plain girl like me to become a princess.

280
01:13:21,314 --> 01:13:23,784
自信ちょっと付いたよ
I've gained a little confidence.

281
01:13:23,884 --> 01:13:26,624
当たって砕けたらバカにして笑ってよ お願い
If I crash and burn, laugh and mock me, please!

282
01:13:26,724 --> 01:13:29,034
行ってきます告白(よし)
Here I go to confess! (Alright!)

283
01:13:29,134 --> 01:13:31,674
ヒロインになれ今日から
I'll become a heroine starting today!

284
01:13:32,074 --> 01:13:34,374
だってだって お姫様自分
Because, because, I'm my own princess,

285
01:13:34,474 --> 01:13:37,024
で決めた孤独くらいは
At least the solitude I chose

286
01:13:37,144 --> 01:13:39,644
わがままにいたなきゃ
Must be treated selfishly.

287
01:13:39,744 --> 01:13:42,204
人生は一度きりよ
You only live once in this life!

288
01:13:42,314 --> 01:13:43,784
デスわ！
That's right!

289
01:13:44,657 --> 01:13:50,257
女神 聖女 聡明 慈愛 博愛 デスわ！
Goddess, saint, wisdom, love, charity—that's right!

290
01:13:50,357 --> 01:13:52,557
きっとヒロインなら綺麗で
Surely if I could be the girl of your dreams,

291
01:13:52,657 --> 01:13:55,057
王子様にチヤホヤされるでしょ?
Pampered by a prince and everything?

292
01:13:55,157 --> 01:13:57,557
芋女の私もお姫様になれたらなんてね
What a dream for a plain girl like me to become a princess.

293
01:13:57,657 --> 01:14:00,757
動きだした運命の歯車
The gears of destiny have started turning.

294
01:14:00,857 --> 01:14:03,457
今日も軽率に ステップする
Today too, I step casually,

295
01:14:03,557 --> 01:14:06,057
運命の弾むような踊りです
With a dance that makes my destiny bounce.

296
01:14:06,157 --> 01:14:08,757
顔を上げたその時 ほら世界が恋をする
When I lift my face, look, the world falls in love!

297
01:14:08,857 --> 01:14:15,157
あたしハッピーエンドプリンセス この人生に置けるヒロイン
I'm the happy-ending princess, the heroine of this life!

298
01:14:15,257 --> 01:14:17,557
突っ込んだ問題ある日々も全部全部
Even all those troublesome days head-on,

299
01:14:17,657 --> 01:14:20,357
愛して見せるのよハッピーエンドプリンセス
I'll show I love them all, happy-ending princess!

300
01:14:20,457 --> 01:14:23,057
自分の物語くらいは
At least my own story

301
01:14:23,157 --> 01:14:26,757
気楽に楽しまなきゃ人生損損
I've got to enjoy casually, otherwise life's a loss!

302
01:14:26,857 --> 01:14:29,357
先行く生き方じゃ未来は変わらない
Following ahead won't change the future,

303
01:14:29,457 --> 01:14:32,757
ときめき感じて もっと自分を讃えよう
Feel the excitement and praise yourself more!

